@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1,ArmR7,ArmL5
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:昨天晚上，<br>我邀请亚里沙和<br>可可<br>协助我进行了<br>一场魔法实验。|#0103Trial04_Margo001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR3,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:我只是被硬拉着<br>陪她胡闹而已。<br>|#0103Trial04_Coco001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,Angle01/Arms>Arms01,Angle01/ArmL-,Angle01/ArmR-,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:我也一样……|#0103Trial04_Alisa001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:结果，<br>汉娜却死了……<br>这说不定就是<br>魔法实验<br>带来的后果呢。<br>|#0103Trial04_Margo002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR1,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Middle,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"毫无疑问，<br>是<link=\"Objection_01_03_04_01\">诅咒</link>夺走了<br>她的生命……|#0103Trial04_Margo003|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

; 恐怖
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Fearful1,ArmR4,ArmL6,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open03
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:诅、诅咒这种东西……<br>怎么可能是真的啊！<br>|#0103Trial04_Alisa002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.ArmR2,ArmL9,Eyes1_Normal_Open2,Mouth1_Surprised_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:总之，<br>我想详细了解一下<br>昨天的具体情况。|#0103Trial04_Nanoka001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.ArmR2,ArmL9,Eyes1_Normal_Open2,Mouth1_Surprised_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:昨晚，<br>远野汉娜确实<br>不在现场，对吧？|#0103Trial04_Nanoka002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:要是她在场的话<br>我们不可能注意不到啊！|#0103Trial04_Alisa003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:但是但是，<br>你们没法<br>证明这一点吧？<br>说不定你们只是<br>没发现她而已！|#0103Trial04_Sherry001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"也许她是<br><link=\"Objection_01_03_04_02\">躲起来了</link>呢。<br>这么一来，之后悄悄<br><link=\"Objection_01_03_04_03\">自杀</link>的可能性<br>也是存在的吧？<br>又或者说，你们三个人<br>其实是<link=\"Objection_01_03_04_04\">串通好了</link>的？|#0103Trial04_Sherry002|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:32,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR4,ArmL6,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open03
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:你想说我们三个<br>是共犯吗？<br>开什么<br>玩笑……！|#0103Trial04_Alisa004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR10,ArmL11,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Closed01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:我只是在探讨<br>各种可能性嘛～！<br>……不可以<br>生气哦☆|#0103Trial04_Sherry003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR2,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open02
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:你这家伙……！|#0103Trial04_Alisa005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR7,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:总之……<br>当我们结束<br>魔法实验<br>打开门时，<br>看守就站在<br>门口。|#0103Trial04_Margo004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR3,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:本来还以为<br>要出事了……<br>但结果无事发生，<br>等我们出来后<br>它就直接上锁离开了。|#0103Trial04_Coco002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4


